{"questions":[{"answer":2,"expl":"0,3636… = 36/99 = 4/11. Eşit.","id":"m-1","qa":"0.363636…, where the digits 36 repeat without end","qb":"<span class='frac'><span>4</span><span>11</span></span>","short":"İki basamaklı devir: devreden kısım / 99.","sub":"Devirli ondalık","topic":"arith","type":"qc"},{"answer":3,"expl":"x = 2, y = 1: 1/2 &lt; 1 → B. x = 1, y = −1: 1 &gt; −1 → A. D.","given":"<i>x</i> &gt; <i>y</i> and <i>xy</i> ≠ 0","id":"m-2","qa":"<span class='frac'><span>1</span><span><i>x</i></span></span>","qb":"<span class='frac'><span>1</span><span><i>y</i></span></span>","short":"Ters çevirmek eşitsizliği yalnızca iki sayı aynı işaretliyse çevirir. İşaret bilinmiyorsa D'ye hazırlıklı ol.","sub":"Ters çevirme ve işaret","topic":"alg","type":"qc"},{"answer":1,"expl":"y − 1 = −2(x − 3) → y = −2x + 7. y-kesişimi 7. x-kesişimi: 0 = −2x + 7 → x = 3,5. 3,5 &lt; 7 → B.","fig":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 260\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:200px\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><line x1=\"20.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"20.0\" y2=\"240.0\" style=\"stroke:var(--fig-grid);fill:none;stroke-width:1\"/><line x1=\"40.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"40.0\" y2=\"240.0\" style=\"stroke:var(--fig-grid);fill:none;stroke-width:1\"/><line x1=\"80.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"80.0\" y2=\"240.0\" style=\"stroke:var(--fig-grid);fill:none;stroke-width:1\"/><line x1=\"100.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"100.0\" y2=\"240.0\" style=\"stroke:var(--fig-grid);fill:none;stroke-width:1\"/><line x1=\"120.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"120.0\" y2=\"240.0\" style=\"stroke:var(--fig-grid);fill:none;stroke-width:1\"/><line x1=\"140.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"140.0\" y2=\"240.0\" style=\"stroke:var(--fig-grid);fill:none;stroke-width:1\"/><line x1=\"160.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"160.0\" y2=\"240.0\" style=\"stroke:var(--fig-grid);fill:none;stroke-width:1\"/><line x1=\"180.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"180.0\" y2=\"240.0\" style=\"stroke:var(--fig-grid);fill:none;stroke-width:1\"/><line x1=\"20.0\" y1=\"240.0\" x2=\"180.0\" y2=\"240.0\" style=\"stro