e:none\"/><text x=\"128.0\" y=\"176.0\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"fill:var(--fig-mute);font-size:11px;font-family:inherit\" >(3, 1)</text><text x=\"64.0\" y=\"48.0\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"fill:var(--fig-ink);font-size:13px;font-family:inherit\" >k</text></svg><p class=\"nts\">Figure not drawn to scale.</p>","given":"In the <i>xy</i>-plane, line <i>k</i> has slope −2 and passes through the point (3, 1).","id":"m-3","qa":"The <i>x</i>-intercept of line <i>k</i>","qb":"The <i>y</i>-intercept of line <i>k</i>","short":"Eğim −2 ise y-kesişimi, x-kesişiminin 2 katıdır (ikisi de pozitifken).","sub":"Doğru denklemi / eksen kesişimleri","topic":"geo","type":"qc"},{"answer":0,"expl":"2¹⁰ = 1.024 &gt; 10³ → 2²⁰ = 1.048.576 &gt; 10⁶.","id":"m-4","qa":"2<sup>20</sup>","qb":"10<sup>6</sup>","short":"2¹⁰ ≈ 10³ ama biraz fazlası.","sub":"Kuvvet karşılaştırma","topic":"arith","type":"qc"},{"answer":2,"expl":"Ardışık üç tam sayıdan en az biri çift, tam olarak biri 3'ün katı. Çarpım hem 2'ye hem 3'e, yani 6'ya bölünür. Kalan 0.","given":"<i>n</i> is a positive integer.","id":"m-5","qa":"The remainder when <i>n</i>(<i>n</i> + 1)(<i>n</i> + 2) is divided by 6","qb":"0","short":"Ardışık k sayının çarpımı her zaman k!'e bölünür.","sub":"Ardışık sayılar / bölünebilirlik","topic":"arith","type":"qc"},{"answer":1,"choices":["<span class='frac'><span>3</span><span>10</span></span>","<span class='frac'><span>1</span><span>3</span></span>","<span class='frac'><span>3</span><span>5</span></span>","<span class='frac'><span>2</span><span>3</span></span>","<span class='frac'><span>9</span><span>10</span></span>"],"expl":"Toplam çift C(5,2) = 10. İkisi de mavi: 1 → en az bir kırmızı: 9 çift. İkisi de kırmızı: C(3,2) = 3. Koşullu olasılık 3/9 = 1/3.","id":"m-6","short":"'Given that' örnek uzayı daraltır: payda 10 değil 9. 3/10 koşulsuz olasılıktır.","stem":"A bag contains 3 red marbles and 2 blue marbles. Two marbles are drawn at random without replacement. Given that at least one of the two marbles drawn is red, what is the probability that both are red?","sub":"Koşullu olasılık","topic":"data","type":"mc"},{"answer":2,"choices":["4","14","16","26","36"],"expl":"Sol: x² + 2x − 15. Sağ: x² + 2x + 1 − k. Sabitler: −15 = 1 − k → k = 16.","id":"m-7","short":"'Her x için' → uygun bir x koy: x = −1 → (−4)(4) = 0 − k → k = 16.","stem":"If (<i>x</i> − 3)(<i>x</i> + 5) = (<i>x</i> + 1)<sup>2</sup> − <i>k</i> for all values of <i>x</i>, what is the value of <i>k</i>?","sub":"Özdeşlik / katsayı eşitleme","topic":"alg","type":"mc"},{"answer":1,"choices":["9π","13.5π","27π","40.5π","81π"],"expl":"Çevre 18π; yay 3π → dairenin 1/6'sı (60°). Alan 81π/6 = 13,5π.","fig":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 220 170\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:220px\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M110,150 L50.0,46.1 A120,120 0 0 1 170.0,46.1 Z\" style=\"fill:var(--fig-soft);stroke:var(--fig-ink);stroke-width:1.6\"/><circle cx=\"110.0\" cy=\"150.0\" r=\"2.5\" style=\"fill:var(--fig-ink);stroke:none\"/><text x=\"72.0\" y=\"98.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" style=\"fill:var(--fig-ink);font-size:13px;font-family:inherit\" >9</text><text x=\"110.0\" y=\"22.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--fig-mute);font-size:11px;font-family:inherit\" >arc length 3π</text></svg><p class=\"nts\">Figure not drawn to scale.</p>","id":"m-8","short":"Dilim alanı = (yay uzunluğu × r)/2 = 3π · 9/2 = 13,5π.","stem":"A sector of a circle with radius 9 has an arc length of 3π. What is the area of the sector?","sub":"Daire dilimi","topic":"geo","type":"mc"},{"answer":1,"choices":["3,700","3,750","3,775","3,800","3,825"],"expl":"1–100 toplamı 5.050. 4'ün katları 4 + 8 + … + 100 = 4(1 + … + 25) = 4 · 325 = 1.300. 5.050 − 1.300 = 3.750.","id":"m-9","short":"Tümleyen: istenmeyenleri toplayıp çıkar.","stem":"What is the sum of all the integers from 1 to 100, inclusive, that are <u>not</u> multiples of 4?","sub":"Toplam (dışlama)","topic":"arith","type":"mc"},{"answer":1,"choices":["1","2","3","4","6"],"expl":"3^(2x + 2) = 3^(3x) → 2x + 2 = 3x → x = 2.","id":"m-10","short":"Her şeyi 3 tabanına çevir.","stem":"If 3<sup>2<i>x</i></sup> · 9 = 27<sup><i>x</i></sup>, what is the value of <i>x</i>?","sub":"Üslü denklem","topic":"alg","type":"mc"},{"answer":{"kind":"dec","value":60},"expl":"240/v − 240/(v + 20) = 1 → 240 · 20 = v(v + 20) → v² + 20v − 4.800 = 0 → (v − 60)(v + 80) = 0 → v = 60.","id":"m-11","short":"Seçenek yok ama tahmin-kontrol hızlı: 60 km/sa → 4 saat; 80 km/sa → 3 saat ✓. 240'ın bölenlerini dene.","stem":"A train traveled 240 kilometers at a constant speed. If its speed had been 20 kilometers per hour greater, the trip would have taken 1 hour less. What was the train's speed, in kilometers per hour?","sub":"Hız problemi (ikinci derece)","topic":"alg","type":"ne"},{"answer":{"kind":"dec","value":7.2},"expl":"Hipotenüs 15. Alan iki yoldan: 9 · 12/2 = 15 · h/2 → h = 108/15 = 7,2.","fig":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 220 180\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:220px\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><polygon points=\"30.0,150.0 30.0,30.0 190.0,150.0\" style=\"stroke:var(--fig-ink);fill:none;stroke-width:1.6\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"136\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" style=\"stroke:var(--fig-ink);fill:none;stroke-width:1.6\"/><line x1=\"30.0\" y1=\"150.0\" x2=\"87.6\" y2=\"73.2\" style=\"stroke:var(--fig-acc-line);stroke-width:2;fill:none\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><text x=\"18.0\" y=\"95.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" style=\"fill:var(--fig-ink);font-size:13px;font-family:inherit\" >9</text><text x=\"110.0\" y=\"168.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--fig-ink);font-size:13px;font-family:inherit\" >12</text><text x=\"83.6\" y=\"91.2\" text-anchor=\"end\" style=\"fill:var(--fig-mute);font-size:11px;font-family:inherit\" >h</text></svg><p class=\"nts\">Figure not drawn to scale.</p>","id":"m-12","short":"h = (dik kenarların çarpımı) / hipotenüs.","stem":"A right triangle has legs of lengths 9 and 12. What is the length of the altitude drawn from the right angle to the hypotenuse?","sub":"Dik üçgende hipotenüse yükseklik","topic":"geo","type":"ne"},{"answer":2,"choices":["14%","35%","43%","50%","65%"],"expl":"11. sınıf toplamı 65. Drama'daki 11. sınıf 28. 28/65 ≈ %43.","id":"m-13","set":"m-di","short":"%35 = 28/80 (Drama'nın yüzde kaçı 11. sınıf) – soru tersini soruyor. Tabanı cümlenin öznesinden bul.","stem":"Approximately what percent of the grade 11 students in the clubs are members of the Drama club?","sub":"İki yönlü tablo / koşullu yüzde","topic":"data","type":"mc"},{"answer":[2],"choices":["Chess","Drama","Science"],"expl":"Chess 10/18 ≈ 0,56 ✗; Drama 30/22 ≈ 1,36 ✗; Science 35/20 = 1,75 ✓. Yalnızca Science.","id":"m-14","set":"m-di","short":"'Indicate all' ama tek doğru var. Drama sınıra yakın: 1,4 · 22 = 30,8 &gt; 30.","stem":"For which of the clubs is the ratio of the number of grade 12 members to the number of grade 10 members greater than 1.4?<br><span class='hint'>Indicate <u>all</u> such clubs.</span>","sub":"İki yönlü tablo / oran","topic":"data","type":"ma"},{"answer":{"kind":"dec","value":50},"expl":"Science: 80 + 10 = 90 üye; 12. sınıf 35 + 10 = 45. 45/90 = %50.","id":"m-15","set":"m-di","short":"Hem pay hem payda değişir.","stem":"Suppose that 10 grade 12 students moved from the Drama club to the Science club and no other changes were made. What percent of the Science club's members would then be in grade 12?","sub":"Tablo / senaryo","topic":"data","type":"ne","unit_after":"%"}],"sets":{"m-di":{"html":"<div class=\"tbl\"><p class=\"cap\">CLUB MEMBERSHIP AT A HIGH SCHOOL, BY GRADE (EACH STUDENT BELONGS TO EXACTLY ONE CLUB)</p><table><thead><tr><th>Club</th><th>Grade 10</th><th>Grade 11</th><th>Grade 12</th><th>Total</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Chess</td><td>18</td><td>12</td><td>10</td><td>40</td></tr><tr><td>Drama</td><td>22</td><td>28</td><td>30</td><td>80</td></tr><tr><td>Science</td><td>20</td><td>25</td><td>35</td><td>80</td></tr><tr class=\"tot\"><td>Total</td><td>60</td><td>65</td><td>75</td><td>200</td></tr></tbody></table></div>","intro":"Questions 13 to 15 are based on the following data."}}}